{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026KaCjQP6Fju1794881610.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>今日天氣提提你：</p><p></p><p>一股偏東氣流正影響廣東沿岸。<br/><br/>本港地區今日天氣預測:<br/>部分時間有陽光。吹和緩東至東南風，初時離岸風勢間中清勁。<br/><br/>展望: 明日稍後轉吹偏北風，雲量增多，晚上氣溫下降。隨後一兩日顯著轉涼，星期五及星期六市區最低氣溫在15、16度左右，新界相當清涼。</p><p></p><p>今日天氣預告由專治屙嘔肚痛嘅李萬山脾胃丸帶俾你。</p><p></p><p>09:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T03:07:11.361726+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T22:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T05:12:55.067408+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T03:00:36.038959+00:00","content_hash":"39dc93b36709af4f9becedcd05ce85a0493e546b2ab99a66a8b50217bfd03704","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}